              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Bauernheinrich is a German trick-taking card game using a compact regional pack and a simple trump-driven trick structure."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A traditional German card game preserved in regional play descriptions rather than as a modern commercial product."
            }
